# NOTE: .env is NOT excluded here (unlike .gitignore)
# EAS Build needs .env to inject API keys at build time.
#
# That means everything in .env is uploaded to Expo's build servers, so .env is for
# the EXPO_PUBLIC_* keys only. Server-side secrets - SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY above
# all, which bypasses every row-level security policy - belong in .env.local, which
# is excluded here and never leaves the machine.
.env*.local

# Store screenshots and generated store art: large, and not part of the app.
